  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T07:46:57.127702Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T07:46:57.127702Z",
  "totalBlocks": 65,
  "translatedBlocks": 65,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75c7ebeb3c914286",
      "translationZh": "在过去几个月里，我们对 transformers 和 tokenizers 库做了多项改进，目标是让从零训练一个新的语言模型变得比以往任何时候都更容易。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1e89fe171395685",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将演示如何用世界语训练一个「小」模型（8400 万参数 = 6 层、768 隐藏维度、12 个注意力头——层数和头数与 DistilBERT 相同），然后在词性标注这一下游任务上对它进行微调。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "452d40ba2cf2511c",
      "translationZh": "世界语是一门以易学为目标的人造语言。本次演示选择它有以下几个原因：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b88814d7d70064dc",
      "translationZh": "它是一种相对低资源的语言（尽管约有 200 万人在使用），所以这个演示比再训练一个英语模型要有趣一些 😁",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c97b47883f518c58",
      "translationZh": "它的语法高度规则（例如所有普通名词以 -o 结尾、所有形容词以 -a 结尾），因此即使数据集很小，我们也应该能得到有趣的语言学结果。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3fdd436c83b7cb6f",
      "translationZh": "最后，这门语言创立时的总体目标就是拉近人与人的距离（促进世界和平与国际理解），可以说这与 NLP 社区的目标不谋而合 💚",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "daa1b850b367ba1e",
      "translationZh": "附注：阅读本文不需要懂世界语，但如果你真想学，Duolingo 上有一门不错的课程，拥有 28 万活跃学习者。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a06d4a819469be6b",
      "translationZh": "我们的模型将命名为……准备好了吗……EsperBERTo 😂",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "06fa9ffaaffeb589",
      "translationZh": "一、寻找数据集",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9448510a9922e1e3",
      "translationZh": "首先，找一个世界语文本语料库。这里我们使用 INRIA 的 OSCAR 语料库中的世界语部分。OSCAR 是一个巨大的多语言语料库，通过对网页的 Common Crawl 转储进行语言分类和过滤而得到。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "533dd6ca5eaf6fcc",
      "translationZh": "数据集的世界语部分只有 299M，因此我们将它与莱比锡语料库集合（Leipzig Corpora Collection）的世界语子语料拼接，后者由新闻、文学和维基百科等多元来源的文本组成。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6983048de622b096",
      "translationZh": "最终的训练语料大小为 3 GB，这仍然不大——对你自己的模型而言，预训练数据越多，效果就越好。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "65881faa93bfc4f2",
      "translationZh": "二、训练分词器",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c91baa8db8630748",
      "translationZh": "我们选择训练一个字节级的字节对编码（BPE）分词器（与 GPT-2 相同），并使用与 RoBERTa 相同的特殊 token。词表大小随意定为 52,000。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14238f6e94bd63b9",
      "translationZh": "我们推荐训练字节级 BPE（而不是像 BERT 那样的 WordPiece 分词器），因为它会从单字节的字母表开始构建词表，因此所有单词都能分解为 token（再也不会有 <unk> token 了！）。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08dfa405693f1254",
      "translationZh": "下面是稍作加速的输出录屏：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f1603b17dc4f6cd",
      "translationZh": "在我们的数据集上，训练大约花了 5 分钟。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c86440c04539ed10",
      "translationZh": "🔥🔥 哇，真快！⚡️🔥",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86ab70011d641d08",
      "translationZh": "现在我们有了 vocab.json（按频率排序的最常见 token 列表）和 merges.txt（合并规则列表）。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9af2fbc0de8adb65",
      "translationZh": "非常棒的一点是，我们的分词器是针对世界语优化的。与为英语训练的通用分词器相比，更多本族词能由单个不拆分的 token 表示。世界语使用的带变音符字母——ĉ、ĝ、ĥ、ĵ、ŝ、ŭ——也得到了原生编码。我们的序列表示方式也更高效：在这个语料上，编码序列的平均长度比使用预训练 GPT-2 分词器时短约 30%。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fed68ca25ebebcb4",
      "translationZh": "下面是在 tokenizers 中使用它的方法，包括处理 RoBERTa 的特殊 token——当然，你也可以直接在 transformers 中使用它。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "394b8f288e5d0d6c",
      "translationZh": "三、从零训练语言模型",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2934ab21ba78c249",
      "translationZh": "更新：配套的 Colab 笔记本现在直接使用我们新的 Trainer，而不是通过脚本。你可以随意选择自己最喜欢的方式。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "166f2a620c613e0f",
      "translationZh": "接下来我们使用 transformers 的 run_language_modeling.py 脚本来训练语言模型（它刚从 run_lm_finetuning.py 改名，因为现在能更顺滑地支持从零训练）。记住：把 --model_name_or_path 留为 None 即可从零开始训练，而不是从现有模型或检查点继续。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b10632f2e0baa9b8",
      "translationZh": "我们将训练一个类 RoBERTa 模型，它是一种 BERT 类模型，但有几处改动（更多细节请查阅文档）。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e045d7a4bf9f0d73",
      "translationZh": "由于是 BERT 类模型，我们将在掩码语言建模任务上训练它，也就是预测如何填回数据集中被随机遮蔽的任意 token。示例脚本已经处理好了这一切。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10cfc529801e025c",
      "translationZh": "我们只需要做两件事：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a778ab6a212311a",
      "translationZh": "实现一个简单的 Dataset 子类，从我们的文本文件中加载数据",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "038e3e2270b61bc1",
      "translationZh": "取决于你的使用场景，如果自带的示例（TextDataset 和 LineByLineTextDataset）够用，你甚至可能不需要编写自己的 Dataset 子类——但根据语料的具体形态，你可能想做许多自定义调整。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b2722a72af9c842",
      "translationZh": "选择并试验不同的超参数组合。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a5befe9a13fa6f0",
      "translationZh": "这是我们 EsperantoDataset 的一个简化版本。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f815d79c7026a5a1",
      "translationZh": "如果你的数据集非常大，可以选择在运行时即时加载并分词样本，而不是作为预处理步骤一次性完成。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0dbc99ab53add9bd",
      "translationZh": "下面是我们传给脚本的一组具体超参数和参数：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e905d360fb5673d9",
      "translationZh": "照例，选择你的 GPU 能装得下的最大批量大小（batch size）。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3055b6d4bd584468",
      "translationZh": "🔥🔥🔥 开始训练！！🔥🔥🔥",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cff935de7f768cdb",
      "translationZh": "在这里可以查看我们在某一组超参数下的 Tensorboard：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4af97864754fcdb",
      "translationZh": "我们的示例脚本默认以 Tensorboard 格式把日志记录到 runs/ 目录。要查看面板，只需运行 tensorboard dev upload --logdir runs——这会设置 tensorboard.dev，一个由 Google 托管的版本，让你能与任何人分享自己的 ML 实验。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e2ad23f5f8574d5e",
      "translationZh": "四、检查语言模型是否真的训练出来了",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f9f3539befb1d57",
      "translationZh": "除了观察训练损失和评估损失下降之外，检查语言模型是否学到了有趣东西的最简单方法就是 FillMaskPipeline。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "847391a5598f22fd",
      "translationZh": "Pipeline 是围绕分词器和模型的简单封装，其中的 fill-mask 可以接收一个含遮蔽 token 的序列（这里是 <mask>），并返回最可能的填充序列及其概率组成的列表。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f64d56cea87c208d",
      "translationZh": "好了，简单的语法结构没问题了。我们来试一个更有趣的提示：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b466e5f7ea6ee789",
      "translationZh": "「Jen la komenco de bela tago」（这是美好一天的开始），确实如此！",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a2a1609eb96cfa6",
      "translationZh": "用更复杂的提示，你可以探究语言模型是否掌握了更多语义知识，甚至某种（统计意义上的）常识推理。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e213add69e5a2d03",
      "translationZh": "五、在下游任务上微调你的语言模型",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a99eb7f71fdd884",
      "translationZh": "现在我们可以在词性标注这一下游任务上微调新的世界语语言模型了。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5ffb58a5e4679df",
      "translationZh": "如前所述，世界语是一门高度规则的语言，词尾通常决定了语法上的词性。使用一份以 CoNLL-2003 格式标注的世界语词性标注数据集（见下方示例），我们就可以使用 transformers 的 run_ner.py 脚本。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7976119c2ee0342c",
      "translationZh": "词性标注和命名实体识别（NER）一样都属于 token 分类任务，所以可以直接使用同一个脚本。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdc25294288d66b5",
      "translationZh": "同样，这里是这次微调的在线 Tensorboard。我们以每 GPU 64 的批量大小训练了 3 个 epoch。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f0902e0694a3462",
      "translationZh": "由于任务相当容易（这门语言很规则），训练损失和评估损失都收敛到较小的残差——不过能端到端训练一遍还是很有趣的 😃。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dccb7e57e7426700",
      "translationZh": "这次我们使用 TokenClassificationPipeline：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "055620e778f8aa93",
      "translationZh": "看起来成功了！🔥",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "066a4846312eb41c",
      "translationZh": "至于更有挑战性的 NER 数据集，@stefan-it 建议我们可以在 WikiANN 的银标准数据集上训练",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a447f49d14ef650",
      "translationZh": "六、分享你的模型 🎉",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51e2fe2918ba02c5",
      "translationZh": "最后，当你得到了一个好模型，请考虑与社区分享：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49ea513edffb546a",
      "translationZh": "用命令行上传你的模型：transformers-cli upload",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80b6e7ca52e07f1b",
      "translationZh": "编写 README.md 模型卡（model card）并加入仓库的 model_cards/ 目录。模型卡最好包含：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e6ae7225a0fe89d",
      "translationZh": "模型描述、",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d052c449d677d48",
      "translationZh": "训练参数（数据集、预处理、超参数）、",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7843f700b0e2213e",
      "translationZh": "评估结果、",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5227d8642c004159",
